        "action_date": "2025-03-24",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Protecting Families from Inflation Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System to study and report to Congress on the collective impact of U.S. tariffs since 2017 on the cost of goods and services for consumers and small businesses in the United States.</p>",
